.TH OMACHAT-CTL 1 "August 2026" "OmaChat 0.0.1"
.SH NAME
omachat-ctl \- control an OmaChat daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B omachat-ctl
[\fB--socket\fR \fIPATH\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status [--json]
Show daemon, relay, storage, join, and outbox state.
.TP
.B fingerprint
Print the stable Noise fingerprint.
.TP
.B fingerprint --qr
Render the same fingerprint as an ANSI QR code using qrencode.
.TP
.B join GEOHASH
Join a public geohash conversation.
.TP
.B leave GEOHASH
Leave a public geohash conversation.
.TP
.B send CONVERSATION TEXT
Queue a public or private message.
.TP
.B panic --confirm ERASE
Cryptographically erase local state and stop the daemon.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success; 2 usage; 3 connection; 4 protocol/remote error; 5 timeout.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR omachat (1),
.BR omachatd (8)
